stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Initiated
    Initiated --> Authenticated: authentication succeeds
    Initiated --> Rejected: integrity or policy failure
    Authenticated --> Authorized: approve or challenge passes
    Authenticated --> Declined: issuer or policy declines
    Authorized --> Cleared: clearing event
    Cleared --> Settled: settlement event
    Settled --> Reported: scam, fraud or dispute report
    Reported --> Recovered: recovery succeeds
    Reported --> LossFinal: recovery window closes
    Rejected --> [*]
    Declined --> [*]
    Recovered --> [*]
    LossFinal --> [*]

